      "changelog": "Initial release of the quality-gate skill for orchestrating egregore's QUALITY pipeline stage.\n\n- Runs convention checks and invokes mapped skills for each quality step, supporting both self-review and PR-review modes.\n- Provides auto-fix logic for blocking findings, with configurable attempts before requiring manual intervention.\n- Integrates with GitHub to post automated review verdicts based on findings (approve, comment, or request changes).\n- Supports fine-grained step selection and skipping via `quality_config` in work items.\n- Filters and applies conventions based on step, as defined by a routing table.",
